  "goal": "Compare people and things with adjective forms like penere, mest interessant, and den peneste.",
  "elements": [
    {
      "kind": "section",
      "role": "orient",
      "title": "Three comparison steps",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "spans": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Norwegian adjectives can show comparison. An adjective describes a noun, such as big, nice, or interesting. You use one form for the basic description, another when something is more, and a third when something is the most."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
